<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/KumariRole> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The role/office of Kumari (living-goddess embodiment) that a person assumes for the duration of a KumariTenure. The role is the type; the tenure is the time-bounded holding of it; the person is the holder."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generatedAtTime> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Time at which this entity was generated (ISO 8601)."@en .
